---
import Icons from './Icons.astro';
---

<section id="philosophy" class="relative py-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="space-y-4 mb-16">
    <span class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#d4ded7]/50 block">Design Philosophy</span>
    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-[#ede8e1] tracking-tight font-normal">
      The Intersection of UX &amp; Computer Science
    </h2>
    <p class="font-editorial text-lg text-[#d4ded7]/70 max-w-2xl">
      Why a technical background elevates interface design—and prevents design debt before code is written.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
    <!-- Pillar 1: Human-Centered Design -->
    <div class="editorial-panel p-8 rounded-sm space-y-4 border border-white/10">
      <div class="font-editorial text-2xl text-[#ede8e1] font-normal pb-2 border-b border-white/10">
        01. Empathy &amp; Research
      </div>
      <p class="font-editorial text-base text-[#d4ded7]/80 leading-relaxed">
        Understanding user mental models through contextual inquiry, ethnographic interviews, and usability testing. Finding the real friction points before sketching solutions.
      </p>
      <ul class="font-sans text-xs text-[#d4ded7]/60 space-y-2 pt-2">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Qualitative Field Interviews</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Usability Testing &amp; Heuristics</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Information Architecture</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 2: Systems Thinking -->
    <div class="editorial-panel p-8 rounded-sm space-y-4 border border-white/10">
      <div class="font-editorial text-2xl text-[#ede8e1] font-normal pb-2 border-b border-white/10">
        02. Systems Rigor
      </div>
      <p class="font-editorial text-base text-[#d4ded7]/80 leading-relaxed">
        Designing with engineering reality in mind. Anticipating asynchronous race conditions, offline modes, API latency, and layout edge cases during the Figma phase.
      </p>
      <ul class="font-sans text-xs text-[#d4ded7]/60 space-y-2 pt-2">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Scalable Token Architectures</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Network Latency &amp; Error Boundaries</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Cross-Platform Component Reuse</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 3: Zero-Friction Execution -->
    <div class="editorial-panel p-8 rounded-sm space-y-4 border border-white/10 rainbow-border">
      <div class="font-editorial text-2xl text-[#ede8e1] font-normal pb-2 border-b border-white/10">
        03. The Sweet Spot
      </div>
      <p class="font-editorial text-base text-[#d4ded7]/80 leading-relaxed">
        "Making sure my dreams aren’t developers’ nightmares." High-polish motion and interaction design delivered as production-ready code rather than handoff compromises.
      </p>
      <ul class="font-sans text-xs text-[#d4ded7]/60 space-y-2 pt-2">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Compilable Native Prototypes</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Production Micro-interactions</li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">&bull; Zero-Loss Handoff Velocity</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
